== Notes ==

* The [[Enhanced Edition]] reduces the stun duration to one round.
* Monks may use this feat ''only'' once per day per monk level (even if their character level would otherwise qualify them for more uses).
* The uses per day for non-monks goes up on the levels immediately after a multiple of four, as if rounding all fractions up.
{|class="wikitable" style="text-align:center;"
